Package: viewos-face-daemon
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ViewOS Project <help@jmultimate.com>
Installed-Size: 4096
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1 (>= 12), libstdc++6 (>= 12), libopencv-core4.08 (>= 4.8), libopencv-dnn4.08 (>= 4.8), libopencv-imgproc4.08 (>= 4.8), libopencv-videoio4.08 (>= 4.8)
Recommends: viewos-kwin-effect
Description: Face tracking daemon for ViewOS head-tracked window perspective
 This daemon captures webcam frames, runs YuNet face detection,
 solves head pose via PnP, and publishes tilt angles over a Unix
 socket for the KWin effect to consume.
 .
 The daemon is written in Rust for performance and memory safety.